CM_ "BATTERY_DC_V1: synthetic DC traction battery bus, one channel battery_hs_can1. Currents are in battery perspective throughout: positive = discharge, negative = charge. Enum legends are carried in signal comments and never in VAL_ tables, because a value table routes the channel to the decoded value_text column and breaks every numeric criterion.";
CM_ BO_ 288 "Multiplexed cell array: 50 mux groups of 4 cells cover Ucell_001 to Ucell_200, so the whole array refreshes every 2,5 s and each cell appears at 0,4 Hz. This frame carries no _BZ counter: the 8-bit mux index is its sequence, advancing on every transmission and wrapping 49 to 0.";
CM_ SG_ 256 BMS_I_Dc "Battery perspective: positive = discharge, negative = charge. This is the one place a reader of the decoded lake can recover the convention.";
CM_ SG_ 256 BMS_State "0 Off, 1 Sleep, 2 Standby, 3 Charging, 4 Discharging, 5 Heating, 6 Fault. Balancing is not a state: it is BMS_State == 1 with BMS_Balancing_Act == 1.";
CM_ SG_ 272 BMS_Soc_Tech "Technical state of charge, pure coulomb counting.";
CM_ SG_ 272 BMS_Soc_Cust "Customer state of charge, the clamped linear map of BMS_Soc_Tech.";
CM_ SG_ 273 BMS_T_Batt "True pack temperature, lumped thermal node.";
CM_ SG_ 273 BMS_T_Derate_Ref "Temperature the derating law used: a first-order lag of BMS_T_Batt. Reported together with the limit in force on the current now on the bus.";
CM_ SG_ 273 BMS_Derating_Fct "Charging current derating factor, 1,0 at or below T_batt_max minus T_batt_safety_threshold and 0,0 at or above T_batt_max.";
CM_ SG_ 273 BMS_I_Chg_Lim "Magnitude, unsigned; the permitted charge current is -BMS_I_Chg_Lim.";
CM_ SG_ 274 BMS_U_Cell_Delta "BMS_U_Cell_Max minus BMS_U_Cell_Min at 0,1 mV resolution, computed from the same cell array BMS_Cell_01 transmits.";
CM_ SG_ 274 BMS_Balancing_Act "Active cell balancing, asserted inside a Sleep residency.";
CM_ SG_ 512 OBC_I_Out "Battery perspective: negative = current delivered into the pack.";
CM_ SG_ 512 OBC_I_Avail "Magnitude the charger can supply.";
CM_ SG_ 768 VCU_Veh_State "0 Off, 1 Sleep, 2 Standby, 3 Drive, 4 Charge.";
CM_ SG_ 768 VCU_Accel_Pedal_Pct "Illustrative only, proportional to positive BMS_I_Dc; zero while plugged in.";
CM_ SG_ 768 VCU_Brake_Pedal_Pct "Illustrative only, proportional to negative BMS_I_Dc; zero while plugged in.";
CM_ SG_ 1024 BTMS_Heater_State "0 off, 1 = P_heater_middle, 2 = P_heater_max. The state the heater is running.";
CM_ SG_ 1024 BTMS_Heater_Req "Heater state the BMS requested this tick.";
CM_ SG_ 1024 BTMS_Chiller_State "0 off, 1 = CHILLER_POWER_LOW, 2 = CHILLER_POWER_HIGH.";

